# This repository holds two Flutter apps. Each app has its own .gitignore for
# Flutter/Dart output; the rules below cover what is shared or lives at the root.

# Signing material. android-keys/vendo-debug.keystore is committed on purpose:
# Google Sign-In and Firebase pin an Android OAuth client to the certificate
# SHA-1, so every build machine must sign with that same public debug key. A
# release keystore and its passwords must never be added.
*.jks
key.properties
!android-keys/vendo-debug.keystore

# Gradle output that sits outside each app's own /build/ rule.
**/android/build/
**/android/.gradle/
**/android/local.properties
**/android/captures/
**/android/app/debug/
**/android/app/profile/
**/android/app/release/

# Flutter/Dart tool output.
**/.dart_tool/
**/.flutter-plugins-dependencies
**/.packages
**/build/
**/.pub-cache/

# Release binaries. Attach APKs to a GitHub release instead of committing them.
*.apk
*.aab

# Editor, OS and local noise.
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
*.iml
*.log
.vscode/
